docs {
  # Admin - Soft Delete Report

  **Method:** `DELETE`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/reports/:id`
  **Auth:** Required (Admin Access Token)

  ## Description
  Performs a soft delete on the report record, setting `deleted_at`.

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "report soft deleted successfully"
    }
  }
  ```
}
